gradeRuleDescribe.course_pol_en:
Please pay attention to the following two things; 
1. Please respect multiculturalism and personal characteristics during class, and do not ridicule other students' questions, ideas and opinions, nor ridicule the culture and life of other countries. 
2. Please pay attention to the issue of gender equality, do not have inappropriate physical touching, and do not bully other students with words.

